{
  "property": "bun-resolve-filter",
  "rule": "packages/unplugin/README.md, Limitations: under Bun the plugin resolves `.vibe` names, extensionless relative names, and a relative `./x.js` only where an `x.vibe` exists",
  "note": "opencode-20, minimized: packages/ai's protocols/utils/fal-queue.vibe is imported as ./utils/fal-queue.js from a .ts module, beside an installed CommonJS package (ws) and an ESM package (@effect/platform-node) whose own relative .js imports must not reach the hook.",
